#: 01-evernight.qml:18
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Evernight Vista New User Guide"
msgstr "Amnir n useqdac amaynut n Evernight Vista"

#: 01-evernight.qml:19
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"The following tools can help you get started quickly and enhance your system "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Ifecka-a d yitranen i k-yellan atan ad ak-d-yefken tazwara akked usnifel n "
"tarmit-ik n unagraw."

#: 01-evernight.qml:44
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Gaming Support"
msgstr "Tallelt n urar"

#: 01-evernight.qml:50
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "About Evernight Vista"
msgstr "Ɣef Evernight Vista"

#: 01-evernight.qml:82
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Nvidia Driver Manager"
msgstr "Amefrak n yiseɣḍanen n Nvidia"

#: 01-evernight.qml:88
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you have an NVIDIA graphics card, use the NVIDIA Driver Manager to "
"install drivers. The Evernight Vista kernel can recognize most hardware "
"drivers, and these drivers can work automatically without installing extra "
"drivers, but NVIDIA drivers need proprietary ones to work properly or to get "
"better performance."
msgstr ""
"Ma tesɛiḍ takarḍit unadim NVIDIA, seqdec Amefrak n yiseɣḍanen NVIDIA i "
"usebded n yiseɣḍanen. Ibel (kernel) n Evernight Vista yezmer ad d-yerr "
"tamussni ɣef uksar n yiseɣḍanen n warrum, yerna yiseɣḍanen-a zemren ad kkren "
"s wudem awurman war ma tesbeddeḍ yiseɣḍanen-nniḍen, maca yiseɣḍanen n NVIDIA "
"sran i yiseɣḍanen imaɣlayen akken ad kkken akken iwata neɣ ad awḍen tussfa "
"yettwaḍfen."

#: 01-evernight.qml:95 01-evernight.qml:138 01-evernight.qml:181
#: 01-evernight.qml:224
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Bdu"

#: 01-evernight.qml:125
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Install Software & Update System"
msgstr "Sebded asseɣlaw u senqed anagraw"

#: 01-evernight.qml:131
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Miryu Software Center can provide security updates, feature updates, and "
"kernel updates for the Evernight Vista operating system, helping to maintain "
"its security, boost performance, and add support for new hardware. In "
"addition, you can also install software from flatpak and linyaps in the "
"Miryu Software Center."
msgstr ""
"Miryu Software Center yezmer ad d-yefk ileqman n tterkilt, ileqman n "
"tmahilin d ileqman n yibelgen i unagraw n wammel Evernight Vista, ay d-"
"yettallen ad yefk lehhu i tterkilt-ines, ad yesnifel tamɣilt-ines ad yernu "
"tallelt i warrum amaynut. Daɣen, tzemreḍ ad tesbeddeḍ aseɣlaw si flatpak "
"akked linyaps deg Miryu Software Center."

#: 01-evernight.qml:168
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "Iɣewwaren n unagraw"

#: 01-evernight.qml:174
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Open the KDE system settings, and you can set up your Evernight Vista "
"operating system your way, like configuring peripherals and appearance."
msgstr ""
"Ldi iɣewwaren n unagraw KDE, tzemreḍ ad tesεedkeḍ anagraw-ik n wammel "
"Evernight Vista s tarrayt-ik, am twila n yisallen uffir d urem."

#: 01-evernight.qml:211
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Btrfs Assistant"
msgstr "Amatewwri n Btrfs"

#: 01-evernight.qml:217
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Using the Btrfs assistant to set up Snapper and create Btrfs snapshots can "
"help you easily roll back the system in case of problems after updating or "
"other issues."
msgstr ""
"Aseqdec n umatewwri n Btrfs i twila n Snapper d tmerna n tugniwin n Btrfs "
"yezmer ad ak-d-yefk tallelt i tririt n unagraw s talwit deg teγmast n ugur "
"ticki yettwalqem neɣ n wuguren niḍen."

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:25
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "About Evernight Vista"
msgstr "Ɣef Evernight Vista"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:40
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "What is Evernight Vista?"
msgstr "D acu i d Evernight Vista?"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:48
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Evernight Vista is a Linux distribution built on Fedora, for every beginner "
"and global user."
msgstr ""
"Evernight Vista d taktabit n Linux i yebnan ɣef Fedora, i yal amenzu d "
"useqdac n umaḍal."

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:57
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Related Links"
msgstr "Izdayen yeɛnan"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:73
msgctxt "@action:link"
msgid "Evernight Vista Official Website"
msgstr "Asmel unṣib n Evernight Vista"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:77
msgctxt "@action:link"
msgid "Support Us on Distrowatch"
msgstr "Fket-aɣ afud ɣef Distrowatch"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:99
msgctxt "@action:link"
msgid "Evernight Vista Project"
msgstr "Asenfar Evernight Vista"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:103
msgctxt "@action:link"
msgid "Fedora Linux Official Website"
msgstr "Asmel unṣib n Fedora Linux"

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:26
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Gaming Support"
msgstr "Tallelt n urar"

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Evernight Vista supports most Wine and Steam games. With Wine and Steam "
"Proton, you can easily play Windows games. However, some games may not run "
"properly under Evernight Vista because of their anti-cheat systems. Or some "
"games' anti-cheat systems use Epic EAC Linux v2, which may also fail to run "
"properly under Evernight Vista, because you may receive an anti-cheat error "
"prompt."
msgstr "Evernight Vista yefk tallelt i umur ameqqran n turar n Wine d Steam. S Wine d Steam Proton, tzemreḍ ad telθeḍ s wul i turar n Windows. Acu kan, kra n turar zemren ur kkren ara akken iwata ddaw Evernight Vista ɣef sebba n yibel n anti-cheat-nsen. Neɣ kra n turar seqdacen anti-cheat Epic EAC Linux v2, ay yezmer daɣen ur yekkir ara akken iwata ddaw Evernight Vista, acku tzemreḍ ad d-tawiḍ tuzna n tḍeṛt n anti-cheat."

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:74
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Related Links: <a href=\"%1\">Epic's Linux Anti-Cheat System</a>"
msgstr "Izdayen yeɛnan: <a href=\"%1\">Anagraw n anti-cheat n Linux ɣef Epic</a>"

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:97
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Install the Official Fedora Kernel"
msgstr "Sbed ibel unṣib n Fedora"

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:103
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If some games' anti-cheat systems use Epic EAC Linux v2 and the games fail "
"to start, try installing the official Fedora kernel, then boot from the "
"official Fedora kernel and try to launch games that use the Epic EAC Linux "
"v2 anti-cheat system again."
msgstr "Ma yella yibel n anti-cheat n kra n turar seqdacen Epic EAC Linux v2 yerna turar ur kkren ara, Ɛreḍ ad tesbeddeḍ ibel unṣib n Fedora, sinna bdu seg yibel unṣib n Fedora yerna ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen ad tebduḍ turar i seqdacen anagraw n anti-cheat Epic EAC Linux v2."

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:110
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Sbed"

#: 03-gaming-support.qml:120
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Note: If you boot from the official Fedora kernel, some driver support may "
"be missing, which may cause some hardware to stop working. It is recommended "
"to boot from the official Fedora kernel only when playing games that use the "
"Epic EAC Linux v2 anti-cheat system."
msgstr "Tamawt: Ma tbdiḍ seg yibel unṣib n Fedora, yezmer ad yeqqel uḍris n kra n yiseɣḍanen, ay yezmer ad yeglu s kra n warrum ur yexdim ara. Yettwasummel ad tbdiḍ seg yibel unṣib n Fedora kan ticki telleḍ turar i seqdacen anagraw n anti-cheat Epic EAC Linux v2."

